# --- the household profile: family, address, names, health, money -----------
# lives in /opt/eva/eva on the Station; eva.example/ shows the format.
# Anchored to the root: a bare "eva/" also hid os/rootfs/files/usr/local/lib/eva/ (the
# Station's audio and boot scripts) from git and the deploy - the mics stayed at an
# experimental 36 dB on the Station and came back after a reboot (2026-11-26)
/eva/
docs/claude_family_context.md
docs/gemini_family_context.md
docs/BACKLOG.md
docs/stt-test/

